````

---

# .env

```env
# Application
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=ASTROGURU
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://astroguru-demo.vercel.app

# MongoDB
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://astroguru_admin:dummyPassword123@cluster0.mongodb.net/astroguru

# Authentication
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=your_nextauth_secret
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://astroguru-demo.vercel.app

# Admin Credentials
ADMIN_MOBILE=9876543210
ADMIN_PIN=1234

# API Keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key

# Cloud Storage (Optional)
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your_cloud_api_key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your_cloud_api_secret

# Email Service (Optional)
EMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your_email_password
````

---

# Short Project Description

ASTROGURU is a web-based astrology consultation platform that allows users to connect with astrologers online, book consultations, access astrology services, and manage profiles through a secure and responsive system powered by MongoDB and Next.js.
